      "text": "- insert:\n    # `name` must be the installed package name so Node resolution finds\n    # the code (a relative path only works for local --patch overlays).\n    - id: portfolio-tracker\n      name: dsh-crypto-portfolio\n      config:\n        # Dashboard port; override in your profile patch or PORTFOLIO_PORT env.\n        port: 8080\n        host: 127.0.0.1\n        # Where profiles (wallets, API keys, snapshot DB) are stored. Leave empty to\n        # use the plugin's own directory, or point it somewhere durable so a plugin\n        # update cannot touch your data. Also honoured: PORTFOLIO_PROFILES_DIR.\n        dataDir: \"\"\n"
    }
